WEBVTT

00:00:03.470 --> 00:00:04.850
Got a bad cold?

00:00:05.260 --> 00:00:06.270
Don't worry!

00:00:06.630 --> 00:00:12.380
<b>New Kanonval X</b>

00:00:06.700 --> 00:00:08.960
This will attack your cold head-on!

00:00:08.960 --> 00:00:11.110
New Kanonval X!

00:00:11.830 --> 00:00:13.720
And that's a wrap!

00:00:14.230 --> 00:00:16.120
Thank you very much.

00:00:16.850 --> 00:00:19.640
This afternoon, you have an 
interview and rehearsal.

00:00:19.640 --> 00:00:21.330
You're always so cute.

00:00:21.330 --> 00:00:23.000
I wouldn't say that.

00:00:23.280 --> 00:00:25.970
In the evening, you have your usual 
radio show and another rehearsal.

00:00:26.880 --> 00:00:29.550
We have a letter from someone 
who goes by "Miki Wakakita."

00:00:29.830 --> 00:00:32.090
You've got a pretty violent swing 
between "on" and "off"...

00:00:32.090 --> 00:00:35.050
Being Kanon all the time is exhausting.

00:00:36.730 --> 00:00:38.050
<i>I wonder if</i>

00:00:38.050 --> 00:00:40.510
<i>my Exalted Brother is doing okay...</i>

00:02:27.940 --> 00:02:30.580
<i>Did I pass out?</i>

00:02:35.920 --> 00:02:37.750
<i>I can't move an inch...</i>

00:02:40.280 --> 00:02:41.750
<i>It's already noon?</i>

00:02:42.690 --> 00:02:46.350
<i>My whole body feels so cold.</i>

00:02:46.350 --> 00:02:47.840
<i>Am I sick?</i>

00:02:48.280 --> 00:02:50.590
<i>And this had to happen while Haqua's gone.</i>

00:02:51.290 --> 00:02:54.440
<i>In retrospect, I haven't felt well since yesterday...</i>

00:02:55.180 --> 00:02:57.690
<i>And spending the night in the 
library just exacerbated it.</i>

00:02:58.160 --> 00:03:01.160
<i>Damn, maybe I shouldn't have come home</i>

00:03:01.160 --> 00:03:03.320
<i>after I brought out Shiori's goddess.</i>

00:03:04.040 --> 00:03:07.340
<i>Still, no point regretting my decision now!</i>

00:03:07.340 --> 00:03:08.860
<i>I have to go to school...</i>

00:03:08.860 --> 00:03:13.710
<i>Inside either Chihiro or Ayumi is 
the final goddess, Mercurius.</i>

00:03:15.630 --> 00:03:17.330
I found him, Nora.

00:03:17.330 --> 00:03:18.890
Looks like he's sleeping.

00:03:19.720 --> 00:03:20.800
You're...

00:03:21.240 --> 00:03:23.090
Hello, it's been a while.

00:03:23.560 --> 00:03:27.350
It's likely he holds the key to all of this.

00:03:27.660 --> 00:03:31.020
So keep an eye on him, Ryo.

00:03:31.250 --> 00:03:34.350
Yep. Just leave this to your brilliant buddy.

00:03:35.290 --> 00:03:37.560
Hey, Nora's stupid buddy...

00:03:37.560 --> 00:03:40.030
Hey, my name is Ryo... Ryo Asama.

00:03:40.310 --> 00:03:41.950
Why are you here?

00:03:43.750 --> 00:03:45.250
Whatever...

00:03:45.730 --> 00:03:47.600
Can you grab that cell phone for me?

00:03:47.600 --> 00:03:49.950
I only follow Nora's orders.

00:03:50.160 --> 00:03:51.630
Cell phone!

00:03:51.630 --> 00:03:53.670
Jeez, fine...

00:03:55.290 --> 00:03:57.270
So, what're you doing? What're you doing?

00:03:57.750 --> 00:03:59.420
Starting the event.

00:03:59.820 --> 00:04:00.880
Event?

00:04:01.460 --> 00:04:03.630
I'm triggering the "sick visit" event.

00:04:05.640 --> 00:04:06.640
<b>Call From Ellie</b>

00:04:07.130 --> 00:04:08.460
Hey, Ellie.

00:04:08.460 --> 00:04:09.780
Not coming to school today?

00:04:09.780 --> 00:04:11.290
What about band practice?

00:04:11.690 --> 00:04:12.840
Hello...

00:04:13.870 --> 00:04:15.020
Is this Ayumi?

00:04:15.020 --> 00:04:15.870
Huh?

00:04:15.870 --> 00:04:16.500
Wait!

00:04:16.500 --> 00:04:17.940
Eh? What?!

00:04:20.370 --> 00:04:21.440
Katsuragi?

00:04:21.790 --> 00:04:24.470
Why are you using Ellie's phone?

00:04:24.470 --> 00:04:26.610
Elsie asked me to call you.

00:04:27.150 --> 00:04:29.500
Something came up, so she 
won't be at school today.

00:04:29.500 --> 00:04:30.450
Something came up?

00:04:30.960 --> 00:04:34.330
Everyone here but me is away 
attending a memorial service.

00:04:34.980 --> 00:04:37.430
So Elsie won't be...

00:04:38.830 --> 00:04:41.700
You don't sound too good.

00:04:42.340 --> 00:04:44.090
A-Are you okay?

00:04:46.410 --> 00:04:47.590
Oh, sorry.

00:04:48.130 --> 00:04:50.700
I have a headache... Did you say something?

00:04:52.160 --> 00:04:53.860
N-Never mind!

00:04:53.860 --> 00:04:54.810
Bye!

00:04:56.580 --> 00:04:58.200
That should do it.

00:04:58.200 --> 00:05:00.310
I hope it's enough to get her to visit.

00:05:03.100 --> 00:05:04.520
Were you on the phone?

00:05:04.520 --> 00:05:06.540
I'm starving!

00:05:07.380 --> 00:05:08.720
Where are you going?

00:05:08.720 --> 00:05:10.830
I forgot a drink. I'm gonna go buy one.

00:05:11.510 --> 00:05:13.340
Please visit me, Ayumi.

00:05:13.340 --> 00:05:14.430
Hey...

00:05:14.740 --> 00:05:20.730
<b>Potato 
Chips</b>

00:05:15.240 --> 00:05:16.800
What's a "sick visit" event?

00:05:17.300 --> 00:05:20.780
The sick visit is as classic 
an event as you can find.

00:05:20.780 --> 00:05:23.630
You can track your progress by 
seeing if a girl visits or not.

00:05:23.630 --> 00:05:25.870
And this is the perfect chance to advance.

00:05:25.870 --> 00:05:27.560
Because I really am sick!

00:05:30.260 --> 00:05:32.070
I'll need your help.

00:05:32.070 --> 00:05:32.930
Huh?

00:05:35.020 --> 00:05:36.770
<b>Call From Chihiro</b>

00:05:35.480 --> 00:05:36.770
Chihiro?

00:05:37.790 --> 00:05:39.200
Hello, Ellie?

00:05:39.200 --> 00:05:41.110
Why aren't you at school today?

00:05:41.110 --> 00:05:45.220
I was thinking of dropping off that 
music I mentioned, if it's okay...

00:05:43.030 --> 00:05:46.470
<i>Sounds like Chihiro doesn't know the situation.</i>

00:05:45.220 --> 00:05:47.950
But if you're not at school, 
does that mean you're sick?

00:05:46.470 --> 00:05:48.510
<i>I can't have them both visit simultaneously.</i>

00:05:47.950 --> 00:05:49.860
Want me to buy you some sweets?

00:05:49.300 --> 00:05:50.780
Elsie isn't home right now.

00:05:52.820 --> 00:05:55.130
Katsuragi? What?!

00:05:55.130 --> 00:05:57.760
The rest of the family went to 
a memorial service today.

00:05:57.760 --> 00:05:59.900
No point in dropping by since 
no one's around, stupid.

00:06:01.770 --> 00:06:03.400
<i>That should keep her away.</i>

00:06:03.400 --> 00:06:05.420
<i>Later tonight, I'll try getting her to visit.</i>

00:06:06.450 --> 00:06:09.180
He didn't have to call me stupid.

00:06:11.180 --> 00:06:12.680
<b>Light Music Club</b>

00:06:11.940 --> 00:06:14.940
Hey, wanna stop somewhere on the way home?

00:06:14.940 --> 00:06:17.790
Yui, how about grabbing some taiyaki?

00:06:17.790 --> 00:06:20.280
Sorry, I have to go home.

00:06:20.280 --> 00:06:21.330
How about you, Ayumi?

00:06:21.330 --> 00:06:23.460
U-Um...

00:06:24.080 --> 00:06:26.440
I have to go straight home, too.

00:06:26.440 --> 00:06:27.670
Huh?

00:06:27.670 --> 00:06:29.410
You guys are no fun!

00:06:29.410 --> 00:06:30.950
Sorry.

00:06:36.390 --> 00:06:38.600
Why do I have to stand watch outside?

00:06:52.180 --> 00:06:53.640
I should just go home.

00:06:53.640 --> 00:06:55.200
Ow!

00:06:55.990 --> 00:06:58.810
Hey! Is anyone there?

00:07:00.060 --> 00:07:02.600
Damn, of course not.

00:07:07.160 --> 00:07:09.940
Excuse me... Is anyone home?

00:07:11.250 --> 00:07:14.450
Damn, I didn't think getting water would be so hard.

00:07:13.100 --> 00:07:14.450
K-Katsuragi!

00:07:14.840 --> 00:07:16.050
Are you okay?

00:07:16.770 --> 00:07:18.740
Huh? Ayumi?

00:07:20.080 --> 00:07:22.420
I wasn't worried about you or anything...

00:07:22.420 --> 00:07:25.280
But you were coughing so hard,

00:07:25.280 --> 00:07:28.020
I had to make sure you weren't dying.

00:07:28.020 --> 00:07:31.700
Like I said before, I don't want 
to talk to you anymore!

00:07:32.990 --> 00:07:34.110
Where are you going?

00:07:34.110 --> 00:07:35.800
My room.

00:07:37.820 --> 00:07:38.810
Hey...

00:07:39.140 --> 00:07:41.120
Are you really home alone?

00:07:41.120 --> 00:07:44.680
I told you, my family won't be back for a while.

00:07:45.840 --> 00:07:48.760
Oh, fine, then...

00:07:48.760 --> 00:07:51.750
If you're this sick, I can't ditch you.

00:07:52.360 --> 00:07:53.500
Up we go...

00:07:58.320 --> 00:07:59.910
You're burning up.

00:08:12.030 --> 00:08:14.280
I didn't expect your room to be so messy.

00:08:14.070 --> 00:08:15.010
<b>This is actually Elsie's room.</b>

00:08:15.010 --> 00:08:16.470
<b>This is actually Elsie's room. 
Arrangement by: Ryo.</b>

00:08:15.130 --> 00:08:16.470
Why me?

00:08:17.210 --> 00:08:19.800
You should keep your room tidier.

00:08:19.800 --> 00:08:21.980
It'll be embarrassing when people come to visit.

00:08:22.700 --> 00:08:24.350
No one ever visits me.

00:08:24.800 --> 00:08:26.510
You're lying. People visit you.

00:08:26.510 --> 00:08:31.360
So I'm a little happy that you 
came to check on me.

00:08:32.650 --> 00:08:34.860
Only a little? That wasn't nice...

00:08:39.420 --> 00:08:40.660
She left?

00:08:42.070 --> 00:08:44.180
You said that you wanted water, right?

00:08:44.180 --> 00:08:45.740
I'll get you some.

00:08:54.940 --> 00:08:57.020
Here. Is this okay?

00:08:57.020 --> 00:08:58.580
Can you sit up on your own?

00:08:59.180 --> 00:09:01.300
Yeah, it's okay...

00:09:01.300 --> 00:09:03.190
Okay. Don't spill it.

00:09:07.240 --> 00:09:09.430
Th-That's a cute cup!

00:09:09.430 --> 00:09:11.530
Makes sense, since there's a café downstairs—

00:09:16.390 --> 00:09:18.480
Be sure you hold it tightly.

00:09:18.710 --> 00:09:19.780
Sorry...

00:09:20.150 --> 00:09:22.060
<i>I didn't expect it to go this well.</i>

00:09:22.060 --> 00:09:24.540
<i>Is this the power of a sick visit event?</i>

00:09:25.470 --> 00:09:27.800
<i>Then I'll take this as far as I can!</i>

00:09:29.160 --> 00:09:31.630
Y-You have to stay in bed.

00:09:31.630 --> 00:09:33.800
You want to get better soon, don't you?

00:09:35.360 --> 00:09:38.350
Now, make sure you stay warm.

00:09:39.360 --> 00:09:40.590
Hey...

00:09:41.010 --> 00:09:41.560
What is it?

00:09:42.090 --> 00:09:45.180
Could you stay a little longer?

00:09:46.640 --> 00:09:49.830
I g-guess I can.

00:09:50.570 --> 00:09:54.900
<i>Good! I feel like crap, but I can take 
it from here with my eyes closed.</i>

00:09:54.900 --> 00:09:57.780
<i>Time to max Ayumi's affection level!</i>

00:10:01.560 --> 00:10:02.890
That was the doorbell.

00:10:02.890 --> 00:10:04.120
I don't feel like answering it.

00:10:04.120 --> 00:10:04.900
Pretend no one's home.

00:10:04.900 --> 00:10:07.580
Hey! Hey!

00:10:09.740 --> 00:10:10.690
Hey!

00:10:10.690 --> 00:10:13.170
<i>Ch-Chihiro?!</i>

00:10:13.480 --> 00:10:14.960
<i>Wh-Why is Chihiro here?</i>

00:10:14.960 --> 00:10:16.800
<i>I took steps to ensure she wouldn't come!</i>

00:10:18.140 --> 00:10:20.680
<i>If she sees me with Ayumi...</i>

00:10:21.250 --> 00:10:22.430
<i>I'll be screwed!</i>

00:10:22.830 --> 00:10:25.030
<i>Hey, Nora's stupid buddy! Do something!</i>

00:10:25.030 --> 00:10:26.620
No answer...

00:10:26.620 --> 00:10:29.740
I just had something I wanted to drop off.

00:10:30.140 --> 00:10:31.810
Is anyone home?

00:10:33.250 --> 00:10:36.250
<i>If a girl shows up, let me know!</i>

00:10:37.310 --> 00:10:39.990
If you need anything, you should 
tell the other buddy.

00:10:39.990 --> 00:10:42.090
He's waiting for you upstairs.

00:10:42.090 --> 00:10:43.080
Buddy?

00:10:43.080 --> 00:10:45.080
<i>That idiot! What is he doing?!</i>

00:10:45.300 --> 00:10:48.480
After completing a mission, I continue 
to follow through without instructions.

00:10:48.480 --> 00:10:50.580
That's what makes me special.

00:10:51.660 --> 00:10:52.340
Upstairs?

00:10:54.300 --> 00:10:56.140
Are those Ellie's?

00:10:56.140 --> 00:10:57.590
She's so messy...

00:10:58.280 --> 00:11:00.210
<i>I don't have time to send Ayumi home.</i>

00:11:00.210 --> 00:11:02.090
<i>That would only lower her affection level.</i>

00:11:03.600 --> 00:11:05.110
<i>I must do something...</i>

00:11:08.670 --> 00:11:10.450
H-Hey!

00:11:15.000 --> 00:11:18.860
Don't make any noise!

00:11:32.040 --> 00:11:33.140
Katsuragi?

00:11:34.190 --> 00:11:36.280
Wh-Why are you here?

00:11:37.140 --> 00:11:40.840
I told you that Elsie isn't home, Chihiro.

00:11:41.710 --> 00:11:42.840
<i>Chihiro?</i>

00:11:48.170 --> 00:11:50.480
Ellie asked me for some sheet music.

00:11:50.840 --> 00:11:52.470
Could you give her this?

00:11:52.710 --> 00:11:53.730
Wait...

00:11:54.450 --> 00:11:57.130
You don't look too good, dweeb.

00:11:57.130 --> 00:11:58.080
Hey...

00:11:59.020 --> 00:12:02.750
Would you go downstairs and 
get me some medicine?

00:12:02.750 --> 00:12:04.860
Huh? You really are sick?

00:12:04.860 --> 00:12:06.180
Are you okay?

00:12:06.180 --> 00:12:08.440
I have a cold...

00:12:09.910 --> 00:12:13.510
Lousy luck, to get sick when 
everyone's out of the house...

00:12:13.510 --> 00:12:14.670
Hold on.

00:12:18.210 --> 00:12:20.760
Wh-Why did I have to hide?

00:12:21.110 --> 00:12:25.760
Because I'm not comfortable with 
other people seeing us together.

00:12:25.960 --> 00:12:30.030
It'll be worse if she sees us here together!

00:12:30.030 --> 00:12:34.140
Then, until Chihiro leaves, you'll have to hide.

00:12:34.760 --> 00:12:36.400
To protect our honor.

00:12:36.620 --> 00:12:38.540
<i>Our</i> honor? This is all your fault!

00:12:38.540 --> 00:12:39.670
Katsuragi?

00:12:40.460 --> 00:12:42.750
Is this the medicine you wanted?

00:12:42.750 --> 00:12:44.280
This stuff is over-the-counter...

00:12:44.520 --> 00:12:46.280
I-It'll be fine.

00:12:50.210 --> 00:12:54.290
K-Katsuragi, this is awkward. U-Um...

00:12:54.870 --> 00:12:59.330
My head is pounding, so can 
you keep your voice down?

00:13:02.340 --> 00:13:05.050
Hey, shouldn't you see a doctor?

00:13:05.610 --> 00:13:09.760
It happened so fast, I didn't have the chance to.

00:13:11.510 --> 00:13:13.340
You have a serious fever!

00:13:14.350 --> 00:13:16.560
<i>What are they doing? I can't hear a thing.</i>

00:13:17.270 --> 00:13:19.230
Want me to open it for you?

00:13:19.580 --> 00:13:22.320
I didn't think you were this nice.

00:13:24.290 --> 00:13:25.700
Didn't think...?

00:13:26.060 --> 00:13:29.200
Isn't this what anyone would 
do for someone who's sick?

00:13:29.590 --> 00:13:31.200
What are you talking about?

00:13:37.350 --> 00:13:38.980
A-Are you okay?

00:13:39.430 --> 00:13:42.120
I appreciate your concern...

00:13:43.720 --> 00:13:46.220
Concern... Well, I just...

00:13:46.560 --> 00:13:48.720
<i>I'm impressed this is going so well.</i>

00:13:48.720 --> 00:13:52.350
<i>Despite my poor condition and a critical accident,</i>

00:13:53.030 --> 00:13:55.100
<i>I'm still raising their affection levels.</i>

00:13:55.790 --> 00:13:59.360
<i>I can pull off this double sick visit event!</i>

00:14:01.280 --> 00:14:03.800
Katsuragi, you seem awfully bulky.

00:14:05.320 --> 00:14:09.680
I w-was shivering, so I added an extra blanket.

00:14:09.680 --> 00:14:10.620
A blanket?

00:14:10.950 --> 00:14:12.950
Shivering? Are you cold?

00:14:14.300 --> 00:14:16.580
Then I'll turn on the heat.

00:14:18.720 --> 00:14:21.340
When you have a cold, staying warm is important.

00:14:21.960 --> 00:14:23.510
Thank you...

00:14:22.460 --> 00:14:24.840
Hot! Hot! Hot!

00:14:23.510 --> 00:14:26.810
You don't want to get dehydrated, 
so I'll get you some water.

00:14:26.810 --> 00:14:27.670
O-Okay.

00:14:28.420 --> 00:14:32.350
Man, why do I have to do this?

00:14:34.670 --> 00:14:36.350
It's too hot!

00:14:40.840 --> 00:14:43.230
Did you pour water on yourself?

00:14:43.230 --> 00:14:45.010
I s-sweat a lot...

00:14:45.010 --> 00:14:45.860
Is there a problem?

00:14:48.990 --> 00:14:50.180
Liar.

00:14:51.080 --> 00:14:53.590
You said no one was coming to visit you.

00:14:54.190 --> 00:14:57.130
Chihiro's here to see Elsie.

00:14:57.130 --> 00:14:58.460
Shut up!

00:14:58.740 --> 00:15:00.570
You called me a blanket!

00:15:00.570 --> 00:15:01.700
You can go—

00:15:03.510 --> 00:15:04.800
I'm coming in.

00:15:06.130 --> 00:15:07.770
Hmm? Katsuragi?

00:15:07.770 --> 00:15:08.340
Yes?

00:15:09.310 --> 00:15:10.360
Your legs are sticking out.

00:15:11.270 --> 00:15:14.790
Shouldn't you wear sweatpants or something?

00:15:14.790 --> 00:15:16.350
It's my choice!

00:15:16.350 --> 00:15:18.350
<i>S-So hot...</i>

00:15:18.610 --> 00:15:20.820
<i>She didn't notice those weren't mine...</i>

00:15:21.250 --> 00:15:22.840
<i>Probably too bizarre.</i>

00:15:26.330 --> 00:15:27.740
Katsuragi,

00:15:28.170 --> 00:15:31.240
do you remember that song from the other day?

00:15:31.720 --> 00:15:32.790
When was that?

00:15:33.040 --> 00:15:35.410
R-Remember... In the music shop?

00:15:35.410 --> 00:15:36.240
Yeah...

00:15:36.840 --> 00:15:41.120
I've finished the n-next part,

00:15:41.880 --> 00:15:45.870
so I wanted you to hear it...

00:15:45.870 --> 00:15:48.320
But if you aren't feeling well, it can wait.

00:15:48.990 --> 00:15:49.920
<i>Huh?</i>

00:15:49.920 --> 00:15:51.640
<i>Didn't she come to see Elsie?</i>

00:15:53.960 --> 00:15:56.010
She did come to see you!

00:15:56.700 --> 00:15:59.270
What's wrong? Are you okay, Katsuragi?

00:15:59.720 --> 00:16:02.420
M-My stomach's hurting a little...

00:16:03.000 --> 00:16:06.770
Anyway, let me hear your song.

00:16:07.100 --> 00:16:09.470
Huh? I-If you're sick, it's fine.

00:16:09.470 --> 00:16:10.320
Go ahead.

00:16:11.400 --> 00:16:13.520
This cold is nothing.

00:16:13.520 --> 00:16:14.780
Your song is more important.

00:16:17.680 --> 00:16:19.750
D-Don't expect anything special.

00:16:20.230 --> 00:16:22.390
<i>This wasn't part of my plan,</i>

00:16:22.390 --> 00:16:24.000
<i>but the completion of that song is crucial.</i>

00:16:24.770 --> 00:16:27.750
<i>I'll have to put Chihiro first, 
even if I lose points with Ayumi!</i>

00:16:28.930 --> 00:16:30.260
Okay...

00:16:31.060 --> 00:16:34.630
The song is basically finished, 
but I don't have any lyrics yet.

00:16:36.430 --> 00:16:39.190
Th-Then, here I go.

00:16:39.190 --> 00:16:40.020
Okay.

00:17:41.820 --> 00:17:43.200
What do you think?

00:17:44.080 --> 00:17:46.750
I only listen to the music from games,

00:17:47.440 --> 00:17:50.290
but I really like your song.

00:17:51.930 --> 00:17:54.810
Are you going to play it at 
the Mai High Festival?

00:17:54.810 --> 00:17:56.670
It won't be done in time.

00:17:56.670 --> 00:17:58.180
The festival's in three days.

00:17:58.790 --> 00:18:01.000
Anyway, I'm leaving now.

00:18:01.820 --> 00:18:03.180
Take care.

00:18:04.760 --> 00:18:05.780
Hey...

00:18:07.380 --> 00:18:11.510
Th-Thank you for listening to my song, 
even though you're sick.

00:18:15.550 --> 00:18:18.070
<i>Looks like I survived.</i>

00:18:18.630 --> 00:18:20.970
<i>And I made good progress with Chihiro.</i>

00:18:21.720 --> 00:18:23.030
<i>Now, about...</i>

00:18:23.030 --> 00:18:24.020
Ayumi?

00:18:29.660 --> 00:18:31.600
Ayumi! Are you okay?

00:18:38.570 --> 00:18:39.760
My shirt's see-through!

00:18:39.760 --> 00:18:41.770
Ah! Stupid, don't look!

00:18:41.770 --> 00:18:44.090
Slimeball! I hope that cold kills you!

00:18:44.090 --> 00:18:46.470
Why are you always so angry?

00:18:47.280 --> 00:18:48.810
What's that supposed to mean?!

00:18:48.810 --> 00:18:50.150
You're the reason I'm angry!

00:18:52.300 --> 00:18:55.500
I wasn't lying... 
I didn't know she was coming.

00:18:56.010 --> 00:18:58.890
Then there's nothing going 
on with you and Chihiro?

00:19:00.870 --> 00:19:03.410
The truth is that I...

00:19:07.200 --> 00:19:08.450
Katsuragi?

00:19:09.630 --> 00:19:12.460
I forgot to tell you something...

00:19:14.830 --> 00:19:16.210
I'm...

00:19:17.220 --> 00:19:19.720
in love with you.

00:19:24.240 --> 00:19:28.020
S-So... T-Tomorrow...

00:19:28.020 --> 00:19:29.100
Sorry.

00:19:29.420 --> 00:19:30.600
Did you say something?

00:19:32.460 --> 00:19:34.860
I nodded off, so I didn't hear what you said.

00:19:35.340 --> 00:19:36.350
Chihiro?

00:19:38.350 --> 00:19:40.280
N-Never mind!

00:19:54.330 --> 00:19:55.490
Katsuragi?

00:19:56.950 --> 00:19:58.500
Were you listening, Ayumi?

00:19:59.150 --> 00:20:01.090
What did Chihiro say?

00:20:01.340 --> 00:20:02.390
Huh?

00:20:02.390 --> 00:20:05.130
You didn't hear it?

00:20:07.800 --> 00:20:10.270
I sh-should get going.

00:20:13.160 --> 00:20:14.410
Wh-What's wrong?

00:20:14.410 --> 00:20:17.650
It's from you hitting me under the blankets...

00:20:17.650 --> 00:20:19.780
Wh-What? You're blaming me?

00:20:20.380 --> 00:20:21.940
<i>I can't let Ayumi leave now.</i>

00:20:21.940 --> 00:20:23.280
<i>Don't give her time to think.</i>

00:20:23.920 --> 00:20:25.790
<i>Still, I can't believe Chihiro...</i>

00:20:25.790 --> 00:20:29.400
<i>That confession caught me completely by surprise.</i>

00:20:29.830 --> 00:20:31.970
<i>I can't handle this alone!</i>

00:20:32.940 --> 00:20:34.840
<i>If only Haqua were here.</i>

00:20:36.470 --> 00:20:39.310
Well? Is she still upstairs?

00:20:39.310 --> 00:20:41.170
I told her I had to use the restroom.

00:20:41.490 --> 00:20:44.100
<i>I misjudged Chihiro's affection level...</i>

00:20:44.910 --> 00:20:47.980
<i>And those two are close friends, 
which just complicates things.</i>

00:20:48.440 --> 00:20:51.180
<i>At this point, my only option is 
to choose one and go all-in.</i>

00:20:51.770 --> 00:20:55.850
Hey, which of those girls do you prefer?

00:20:55.850 --> 00:20:58.810
I'd go with, uh...

00:20:58.810 --> 00:21:00.640
Which one to choose?

00:21:00.640 --> 00:21:04.200
<i>Exactly... Which do I conquer first?</i>

00:21:04.220 --> 00:21:05.660
<b>Chihiro</b>

00:21:04.710 --> 00:21:05.660
<i>Chihiro!</i>

00:21:05.660 --> 00:21:09.720
<b>Calling Chihiro</b>

00:21:07.530 --> 00:21:09.120
<i>I'm...</i>

00:21:09.120 --> 00:21:11.340
<i>in love with you.</i>

00:21:11.730 --> 00:21:14.210
I'm sorry. I actually heard you.

00:21:14.880 --> 00:21:17.220
I heard your confession.

00:21:23.170 --> 00:21:23.880
Hello?

00:21:24.710 --> 00:21:27.430
I heard...

00:21:29.640 --> 00:21:31.390
Chihiro, answer the phone!

00:21:32.010 --> 00:21:36.150
Chihiro, are you in love with Katsuragi?

00:21:38.110 --> 00:21:39.110
Huh?

00:21:39.110 --> 00:21:40.860
What do you mean, you heard?!

00:21:41.470 --> 00:21:42.940
What did you hear?

00:21:43.230 --> 00:21:44.150
Oh...

00:21:44.650 --> 00:21:46.970
I heard some rumors...

00:21:46.970 --> 00:21:48.450
What was that?

00:21:48.450 --> 00:21:49.440
Never mind.

00:21:50.680 --> 00:21:52.980
And right now, where are you, Ayumi?

00:21:52.980 --> 00:21:55.610
O-Oh, I'm... Um...

00:21:57.010 --> 00:21:58.140
Actually...

00:21:59.100 --> 00:22:02.710
I kind of confessed my feelings...

00:22:04.400 --> 00:22:05.720
To Katsuragi?

00:22:05.940 --> 00:22:09.030
I just lost it for a moment.

00:22:09.030 --> 00:22:11.450
I was kind of talking to myself.

00:22:11.450 --> 00:22:13.720
He wasn't listening anyway...

00:22:14.150 --> 00:22:15.770
I don't know what came over me.

00:22:15.770 --> 00:22:21.090
Maybe after asking so many guys out, 
I'll take anyone at all now...

00:22:21.090 --> 00:22:22.070
That isn't true.

00:22:25.570 --> 00:22:28.740
You've found true love.

00:22:29.950 --> 00:22:32.120
I'm rooting for you!

00:22:40.540 --> 00:22:41.490
Ayumi?

00:22:42.050 --> 00:22:43.750
Hello?

00:22:46.270 --> 00:22:47.830
A-Ayumi?

00:22:51.980 --> 00:22:53.860
Are you feeling better?

00:22:53.860 --> 00:22:55.450
Yeah, much.

00:22:55.450 --> 00:22:56.230
Good.

00:22:57.020 --> 00:22:58.600
Then I'm going home.

00:23:01.340 --> 00:23:03.730
My cold's worsening again...

00:23:08.560 --> 00:23:09.930
Don't worry.

00:23:09.930 --> 00:23:12.870
I'll ask Chihiro to come and take care of you.

00:23:13.390 --> 00:23:15.010
<i>What? It isn't working?</i>

00:23:16.630 --> 00:23:18.620
Ayumi, are you mad?

00:23:18.990 --> 00:23:20.980
Why would I be mad?

00:23:21.750 --> 00:23:23.560
Be nice to Chihiro.

00:23:23.980 --> 00:23:24.710
Bye.

00:23:30.090 --> 00:23:32.470
<i>Ayumi's anger is gone?</i>

00:23:32.470 --> 00:23:34.430
<i>And she keeps bringing up Chihiro.</i>

00:23:35.450 --> 00:23:36.980
<i>I don't get it,</i>

00:23:36.980 --> 00:23:39.160
<i>but I have a bad feeling about this.</i>

00:23:42.980 --> 00:23:44.480
<i>What...</i>

00:23:45.490 --> 00:23:47.400
<i>...should I do now?</i>

00:23:49.010 --> 00:23:52.160
Well, it is what it is.

00:23:54.440 --> 00:23:55.660
Was Ayumi...

00:23:56.170 --> 00:24:00.370
at Katsuragi's house?

00:24:05.000 --> 00:24:20.860
<b>Goddess Mix</b>

00:24:06.500 --> 00:24:07.800
Chihiro and Ayumi.

00:24:07.800 --> 00:24:10.180
They're classmates, bandmates, 
and good friends.

00:24:10.180 --> 00:24:12.720
So when I conquer them, 
I must be very careful.

00:24:12.720 --> 00:24:13.760
This is such a pain!

00:24:13.760 --> 00:24:16.760
If the last goddess were in someone like 
Haqua, this would be much easier.

00:24:16.760 --> 00:24:19.550
Huh? Where did she go, anyway?
